+---
+id: task-003-fix-coupon-cancellation-and-free-shipping-threshold
+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon cancellation and free shipping threshold"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Fixed cancellation to return a single-use coupon using the order ID that redeemed it, allowing a
+corrected order to use the coupon again. Added a regression test covering Paolo's same-day
+cancellation and re-order.
+
+Verified that free delivery at exactly €50.00 is already implemented with an inclusive threshold and
+is covered by the existing order-pricing test. Ran the complete test suite successfully.
